Subject: [PATCH 80/85] hw/misc: LED Ring R Click (four 74HC595) on mikroBUS

LED Ring R Click v100: 32 red LEDs on four chained 74HC595 (length 4),
LATCH on CS, MR# on RST, no pull resistors. The first byte of a
transfer ends in the last register: byte 0 is LED1-LED8, in bits 31:24
of "outputs"; LED25-LED32 are register 0, bits 7:0.

qtests: a 32-bit frame latched on the MC00's EXT1 and on the AVR64EA48
Nano Base's socket 1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
